      "title_size": "sm",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": "Diagnostics",
      "order": 2,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "Coverage against variant count separates a genuinely divergent sample from one that is simply under-sequenced: both produce few calls, but only one of them is well covered. The Nextclade panel beside it says the same thing from the consensus side.",
      "wf_tag": "nextflow/viralrecon"
    },
